# Golden G-M3-2 (DESIGN §29.5 G2 shape): record a progression from sparse
# input with sloppy timing, quantize-after to whole bars, then loop it.
# While recording, each play ALSO sounds live (double output, D13).
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth
seq new verse
seq rec
@0     play D
@3910  play G
@7615  play C
@11540 play A
advance 15360
seq stop
chord stop
seq loop on
seq play
transport start
advance 7680
transport stop
quit
